conclude (by the same lemma again) that\n<MATH_0012> is locally of finite presentation.\nAs <MATH_0013> is an fpqc covering we conclude that\n<MATH_0014> is locally of finite presentation by\nDescent,\nLemma <REF_0004>\nas desired.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:85ded07d25b0e8eecb9c675fa7e7f3203931ba591acdf6deb13bb5cae07489ce", "unit_id": "tag:041T:proof"}
